+        state.BUILT: (f"`pdca run {issue}` runs CHECK on the residue patch.diff — gates, "
+                      "reviewer, adversary — NOT Do. To rebuild instead, move patch.diff "
+                      "aside first; or let Check run and record `iterate-do` at sign-off, "
+                      "which archives this attempt to iteration-v<N>/ and rebuilds."),
+        state.CHECKED: (f"`pdca run {issue}` ASSEMBLES SUMMARY.md over the residue and "
+                        "stops at sign-off — no Do. Record `iterate-do` there to archive "
